{
  "logo": "https://cdn.uppromote.com/storage/uploads/logo/1783488671_5602249_477317560e99225c48bba2cd8ba62f88.png",
  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><div><p style=\"border:0px solid;margin:0px;padding:0px;color:rgb(10,10,10);font-family:'Anthropic Sans', 'system-ui', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(253,253,252);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\"><strong style=\"border:0px solid;margin:0px;padding:0px;font-weight:500;\">About our brand and products:</strong></p><p style=\"border:0px solid;margin:0px;padding:0px;color:rgb(10,10,10);font-family:'Anthropic Sans', 'system-ui', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(253,253,252);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\"><br style=\"border:0px solid;margin:0px;padding:0px;\">Rollz is a European brand for premium hemp-derived products — THCA and HHC flowers, hash, prerolls, vapes and edibles, made in Europe and shipped discreetly within 24 hours. Through rollz.pl we serve customers across Poland, with a strong base of loyal, regularly reordering customers.</p><p style=\"border:0px solid;margin:0px;padding:0px;color:rgb(10,10,10);font-family:'Anthropic Sans', 'system-ui', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(253,253,252);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\"><br></p><p style=\"border:0px solid;margin:0px;padding:0px;color:rgb(10,10,10);font-family:'Anthropic Sans', 'system-ui', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(253,253,252);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\"><strong style=\"border:0px solid;margin:0px;padding:0px;font-weight:500;\">What makes us different:</strong></p><p style=\"border:0px solid;margin:0px;padding:0px;color:rgb(10,10,10);font-family:'Anthropic Sans', 'system-ui', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(253,253,252);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\"><br style=\"border:0px solid;margin:0px;padding:0px;\">Premium quality at fair prices, made in Europe — no imported bulk goods. Fast, discreet delivery, a real support team, and products people genuinely reorder: our customers come back, which is exactly what makes our affiliate model profitable for you. While most programs pay you once, we pay you on every order your referral places for a full 60 days.</p><p style=\"border:0px solid;margin:0px;padding:0px;color:rgb(10,10,10);font-family:'Anthropic Sans', 'system-ui', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(253,253,252);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\"><br></p><p style=\"border:0px solid;margin:0px;padding:0px;color:rgb(10,10,10);font-family:'Anthropic Sans', 'system-ui', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(253,253,252);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\"><strong style=\"border:0px solid;margin:0px;padding:0px;font-weight:500;\">How affiliates can earn:</strong></p><p style=\"border:0px solid;margin:0px;padding:0px;color:rgb(10,10,10);font-family:'Anthropic Sans', 'system-ui', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(253,253,252);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\"><br style=\"border:0px solid;margin:0px;padding:0px;\">You earn 10% commission on every order from new customers and 5% on orders from existing customers — not just on the first purchase, but on every single order placed within 60 days of your referral's first order. Commissions apply to paid and collected orders. With regular consumers in your circle, an extra 1,300–2,100 zł is realistic. Free to join, no minimum requirements.</p><p style=\"border:0px solid;margin:0px;padding:0px;color:rgb(10,10,10);font-family:'Anthropic Sans', 'system-ui', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(253,253,252);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\"><br></p><p style=\"border:0px solid;margin:0px;padding:0px;color:rgb(10,10,10);font-family:'Anthropic Sans', 'system-ui', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(253,253,252);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\"><strong style=\"border:0px solid;margin:0px;padding:0px;font-weight:500;\">How to promote us:</strong></p><p style=\"border:0px solid;margin:0px;padding:0px;color:rgb(10,10,10);font-family:'Anthropic Sans', 'system-ui', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(253,253,252);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\"><br style=\"border:0px solid;margin:0px;padding:0px;\">Share your personal referral link wherever your people are: friends and group chats, Telegram/WhatsApp communities, social media bios, stories and posts, or your own content (reviews, unboxings, recommendations). You don't need to be an influencer — if people around you already order these products, you just need to be the one who sends the link.</p><p style=\"border:0px solid;margin:0px;padding:0px;color:rgb(10,10,10);font-family:'Anthropic Sans', 'system-ui', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(253,253,252);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\"><br></p><p style=\"border:0px solid;margin:0px;padding:0px;color:rgb(10,10,10);font-family:'Anthropic Sans', 'system-ui', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(253,253,252);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\"><strong style=\"border:0px solid;margin:0px;padding:0px;font-weight:500;\">Other information:</strong></p><p style=\"border:0px solid;margin:0px;padding:0px;color:rgb(10,10,10);font-family:'Anthropic Sans', 'system-ui', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(253,253,252);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\"><br style=\"border:0px solid;margin:0px;padding:0px;\">The program is currently open for rollz.pl (Poland); more countries will follow. Audience must be 18+. Please promote responsibly: no health or medical claims, no targeting of minors. Program details:</p><p style=\"border:0px solid;margin:0px;padding:0px;color:rgb(10,10,10);font-family:'Anthropic Sans', 'system-ui', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(253,253,252);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\"><br></p><p style=\"border:0px solid;margin:0px;padding:0px;color:rgb(10,10,10);font-family:'Anthropic Sans', 'system-ui', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(253,253,252);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\"><a href=\"https://community.rollzflowers.com/affiliates-pl\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"text-[var(--accent)] hover:underline underline-offset-[1px] outline-none hide-focus-ring ring-focus rounded-r2\" style=\"border:0px solid;margin:0px;padding:0px;color:rgb(0,115,230);text-decoration:none;\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">https://community.rollzflowers.com/affiliates-pl</a></p></div></div>",
